      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This overwhelming shame and fear of judgment are common survival responses to sudden loss, but they do not reflect your true worth or the reality of others' minds long after the initial shock fades. Please reach out to a crisis counselor who can help you process these intense feelings safely, as they can guide you through this painful terrain without justifying your pain. You are stronger than the image people form in a moment of distress, even if the weight of them feels unbearable right now.",
