      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that the fall is so slow and humiliating. everyone thinks things will \"get better\" or \"time heals,\" but they don't understand that some things just break you permanently. it's like i'm watching a movie of my own life failing and i can't turn it off. would it really be so wrong to just want the descent to end before i hit the bottom? to just stay in control of how things conclude?",
